# box-drag-ctrl (h5-box): k's box dragged 30 px, Ctrl pressed mid-drag.
# The value snaps to the whole (0.6 -> 1) with the warning outline.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 331.5 494.5
down
move 361.5 494.5 over 80
hold Control
shot box-drag-ctrl
up
release Control
wait 1200
